      "message": "Are CMD_RESTART_VAL and CMD_STOP_VAL mutually exclusive?\n\nI\u0027m wondering if the \"else\" should be dropped here to handle \"len\u003d1\" case differently.",
      "revId": "487cf0bddfc02c1635380ddebb40b3f6169afc38",
